      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Hysteroscopy"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " = the gold strd for intrauterine struct Eti; saline-infusion sonohysterography helps characterize sm lesions such as polyps and submucous fibroids."
